version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-07-15

abstract: >
  Fox-Li LASER Cavity Simulator is a graphical desktop application for
  numerical simulation and analysis of optical laser resonators using the
  Fox-Li iterative method. The repository provides both NumPy and JAX
  implementations for CPU-based simulation and optional hardware-accelerated
  execution on supported systems.

